000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SQL7.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01 WS-STMT PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
000600 01 WS-ID PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
000700 01 WS-N PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
000800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000900     EXEC SQL CREATE TABLE T (ID INTEGER) END-EXEC.
001000     MOVE "INSERT INTO T VALUES (?)" TO WS-STMT.
001100     EXEC SQL PREPARE S1 FROM :WS-STMT END-EXEC.
001200     MOVE 5 TO WS-ID.
001300     EXEC SQL EXECUTE S1 USING :WS-ID END-EXEC.
001400     EXEC SQL SELECT ID INTO :WS-N FROM T END-EXEC.
001500     DISPLAY WS-N.
001600     STOP RUN.
